	// leave the window out, the engine reranks the smallest of 100 and `maxRerankWindow`, and no more than
	// the `hybrid.depth` of a hybrid query that sets one. A hybrid query that sets `hybrid.depth` reranks
	// its fused list at that depth, so the engine throws `RERANK_CONFIG_INVALID` when you set a window
